    "prompt": {
      "description": "A bare-headed figure in a heavy segmented breastplate, standing planted with the feet wide apart and both hands empty and open at the sides. No helmet, no hat, no hood: cropped hair, blunt face, heavy brow. Set into the centre of the breastplate is a small square iron window, barred across, with fire burning behind the bars; thick metal frames it hard on all four sides and no fire escapes it. Narrow shoulders over a wide braced stance, short thick legs, bare forearms. Nothing is carried and nothing hangs off the body.",
